    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lone samurai, driven by grief and vengeance, walks the path of blood.</strong><br>His family has been torn from him\u2014his wife slain, his daughter stolen by unknown hands. With nothing left but his blade and unyielding rage, he embarks on a relentless quest for justice. Strike down those who stand in your way, master the art of the sword, and carve your revenge into the world itself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced, skill-based combat</strong> \u2013 Use directional inputs to clash against enemies in intense duels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade-style challenge</strong> \u2013 No two runs are the same. Adapt, refine your technique, and push for mastery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world steeped in mystery</strong> \u2013 Travel through the land of clouds, uncover secrets, and hunt those responsible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful upgrades</strong> \u2013 Discover items to aid you in battle and shape your path to vengeance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to embrace the way of the blade?</p>",
